abstract: >-
  DraftScope is a Python command-line research tool for auditable NCAA-to-NFL
  prospect benchmarking, draft-likelihood modeling, player comparisons, and
  evidence-weighted NFL team-fit analysis.
keywords:
  - NCAA football
  - NFL Draft
  - sports analytics
  - scouting
  - predictive modeling
